      "sample_index": 3,
      "text": "Let's take the natural log on both sides. We get $(x+7) ln7 = x \\ln 8$.\nDividing both sides by x, we get $ln7 +ln7\\ln7 = \\ln8$.\nSubtracting ln7 from both sides, we get $ln7\\ln7 = \\ln8 - ln7$.\nDividing both sides by ln7, we get $\\ln7 = \\frac{\\ln8}{\\ln7} - 1$.\nAdding 1 to both sides, we get $\\ln7 + 1 = \\frac{\\ln8}{\\ln7}$.\nMultiplying both sides by ln7, we get $ln7\\ln7 + ln7 = \\ln8$.\nMultiplying both sides by -1, we get $ln7\\ln7 - ln7 = -\\ln8$.\nTherefore, $8 = -\\ln7(\\ln7 - 1)$.\nThus, $b=\\boxed{7}$. The answer is: 7",
